(text "What stays of the baseline inputs + outputs sheets after the card split. Free\nU62 inputs read SL1-8_PRESENT_N; U63 S1 GLOW_SNSM, S2 ESTOP_TRIP_SNSM (new\nBAT54C clamp next to U63), S3-S8 GND. U30 AIN1-3 / U29 AIN2 unused (AI-4\ncard). U91 gates 3-4 and U92 gates 1-2 unused (inputs GND); U92 gate 4 =\nGLOBAL_OUT_ALLOW = SH_ALLOW (WD_OK AND NRST_S) AND SLOT_RST_N. Baseline sheet\nnotes: docs/modular/mainboard_sheet_notes.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 208.28 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eb380f13-32af-41a9-8a8e-2ad234490f32"))
(embedded_fonts no))
